{"parse": {"title": "末日与末日之后-01", "pageid": 101314, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BA%93%E7%8F%80%E8%8A%B1%E7%8E%AF%C2%B7%E6%9C%AB%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AB%E6%97%A5%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E\" title=\"库珀花环·末日与末日之后\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">末日与末日之后-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9C%AB%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AB%E6%97%A5%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E-02\" title=\"末日与末日之后-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">末日与末日之后</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.9D.80.E9.99.86\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"着陆\">着陆</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 着陆</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Earthbound</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>近些日子，她常做同一个梦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梦中双眼像是被蒙上了一层雾，口中只能发出不成词句的呓语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>包裹住她的是一片虚空。它无边无际，却空无一物。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_bg_xueshan\"><img alt=\"2_4_bg_xueshan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>恐惧攫住了她。<br />因此她张口——发出第一声啼哭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">襁褓中的女孩：</div><div>咿——呀……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但微弱的声音被风雪吞没，寒风无情地撕裂了一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冥冥之中，她感知到自己降生的这个世界广袤无垠，可似乎没有哪一方角落是留给她的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">襁褓中的女孩：</div><div>唔……呀……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>意识逐渐远去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不过隐约间，她听到犬吠声刺破寒风，有湿漉漉的温热鼻头拱上她冻僵的脸庞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-611820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-611820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-611820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">雪橇犬：</div><div>汪……汪汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-633101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-633101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-633101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">科兹洛夫：</div><div>慢些、慢些，你这调皮的姑娘！<br />你发现了什么？难不成又是一只小熊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-633111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-633111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-633111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">科兹洛夫：</div><div>——我的天哪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笑意被抽气声取代，挟在风雪中飘来的话语戛然而止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>脚步声急切地碾过松软的雪地，眨眼间便来到了耳畔。<br />随后——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_bg_xueshan\"><img alt=\"2_4_bg_xueshan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>天旋地转。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">科兹洛夫：</div><div>可怜的孩子，你都冻坏了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">科兹洛夫：</div><div>看你的小手……居然这样冰冷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她被来人一把抱起，裹在了大衣的底下。<br />世界像是忽然变小了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">襁褓中的女孩：</div><div>咿……呀……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但这一方小世界却是如此温暖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>呼啸的风雪再钻不进分毫，冰冷的四肢逐渐取回了温度，一切都是那样令人安心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">科兹洛夫：</div><div>没事了，孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">科兹洛夫：</div><div>都没事了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>一条、两条、三条……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>不多不少，一共七条。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>和我最后一次离开这里的时候一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少女点了点头，满意地收回观察生态缸中热带鱼的目光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>自太空归来后便是长达数日的观察期，踏出隔离病房时恍若隔世。<br />此刻她终于感到自己的双脚落在了地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但一旁飘来的话语，却让少女刚刚扬起的笑容一滞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>其实我订了十条。但“暴雨”刚过，到处都乱成了一锅粥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>负责的人说，除非我们有个只以热带观赏鱼为食的家伙快饿死了，否则实在没法把这东西列入紧急物资清单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>这七条是他自己养的。因为看重咱们研发的传送软盘未来能让他的工作方便不少，才以个人名义借给我的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>您的意思是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>的确还是七条，但不是之前那些老伙计了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蛇发女妖挑起藏在发间的某位手足。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你们几个记住，这次可不许偷吃，不然要赔的。<br />现在我这兜里可没有几个钱了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅰ：</div><div>还不是因为你非要在分部这边布置个一模一样的实验室！<br />原本的那间被冲走了就冲走了呗！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅰ：</div><div>那搓香灰毫无疑问是在蝾螈大开口，本来这个月的津贴就还没到账，你还这样大手大脚！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>库珀花环带回来的数据还没有分析完，一致的研究环境有助于让我的思维保持一贯性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>等等，刚才有蛇说了有失公允的话！<br />我给的可都是公道的价格！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>别看只是些桌椅板凳，这种非常时期，可不是随便就能给你搞到的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>睡在桌边的小生物也加入了那场手足间的争执中，不大的实验室内顿时热闹了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但那些声音于库珀花环而言却是那样遥远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>“暴雨”……回溯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>说者无意，但话语中夹杂着的那几个关键词格外刺耳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她下意识地移开视线，一旁的生态缸却闯入视野。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鱼儿正在水中嬉戏，这景致本应令人心生愉悦，但脑海中却回响起了冷周六方才的话语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>不是原来那些了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>他们……不在了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵眩晕感袭来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仿佛忽然被放逐至无重力的太空，但所有星星却都不见踪迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>深不见底的黑暗中，她感受到某个巨大的存在，它的引力拉扯着她开始坠落、坠落——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>——所以，你怎么打算？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>咦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一枚漂亮的信封递到了她的面前，岌岌可危的意识被拉回了地面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>这是……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我就知道，一看你刚才就在走神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>圣洛夫基金会的邀请函——“可敬的宇航员小姐收”的那封。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>说是基金会那边对咱们干成的事很感兴趣，要联合拉普拉斯办一个兼具交流会性质的庆功宴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你认识的和不认识的都在名单上——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>怎么这副表情？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我……我只是做了我力所能及的事情而已，这并不是什么值得被大加夸赞的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>比起参加庆功宴，也许有更加重要的事需要我去做。<br />比如——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她停顿了一秒，将那个词说出了口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>关于“暴雨”……有什么进展了吗？还有什么我能做的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她渴望着一个好消息，一个她自己也说不清具体希望是什么的好消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可回应她的是冷周六平静的面庞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你带回来的数据很有用，一切都在推进中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>但现在你也是拉普拉斯的人了，该明白面对“暴雨”这样的课题，指望短时间内就有突破不现实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员拍了拍小宇航员的肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>耐心点。<br />你已经完成了职责，现在该我们这些坐办公室的出马了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>通常我是不会说这种话的，但拜托，你刚从太空回来，几乎九死一生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你需要的是休息和放松，而不是工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但小宇航员仍然愁眉不展。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>……或者这样吧。拿着这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>三张熟悉的物件，和邀请函一起被拍在了库珀花环的怀里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>这是我们之前用过的传送软盘？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>根据你回程时的数据改良后的版本。<br />现在理论上只需默念目的地，就可以触发术式了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>庆功宴是在一周后，如果这期间你闲不住，正好可以帮我收集些这东西的体验数据。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少女天蓝色的眼眸顿时明亮了几分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>好的，没问题！请交给我吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可随即，像是想起了什么，她又迟疑了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>但……要使用它们，就代表需要有一个传送的目的地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我应该去哪里呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蛇发女妖好整以暇地笑了笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>随便，这就看你了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>关上身后温室办公室的房门，库珀花环轻声叹出了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-311801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-311801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-311801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>库珀花环小姐，怎么了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-311801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-311801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-311801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>这可不是世上第一个从宇宙确认“暴雨”现象的小宇航员该露出的表情。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "末日与末日之后-01"}}